{
  "description": "Operator truth table (prompt 017). Each row is one condition {path, op, value} evaluated on payload. expected is whether the condition holds; ambiguous marks rows where the value is missing, JSON null or of another type than the operator expects (SQL yields NULL, Java AMBIGUOUS). RuleSqlBuilderIT and TriggerPersistGateTest both consume it.",
